{"data":{"body":"**[P3] Lock custom output directories while runs are active**\n\nThe new lock protects automatic run directories only. Because checkout locks are per JS checkout, two supported concurrent runs using different checkouts and the same `--out` let the later run delete the first run's live maps and logs here. Hold an output lock for the complete `run_tests` scope and refuse or wait on an active directory; add a cross-checkout concurrency test.","comment_node_id":"PRRC_kwDOPsIIsM75N45x","finding_digest":"0222f837a286f1dfbb33cf815e5beac15718e9628fa3b9740351cb09be160d3a","finding_id":"arf_v1_airpqn5cq3y57oztz6av4w7kyf","finding_key":"github/scripts/js_examples/run.py::prepare_out::active-output-directory-deletion","identity_key":"github/scripts/js_examples/run.py::prepare_out::active-output-directory-deletion","line":964,"observation_digest":"03dba4900ab5628c607dda459dfad4693607027a9a6db80330838c0b1346eb15","observation_id":"aro_v1_apn2jeakwvriyyd53jcz36wune","path":".github/scripts/js_examples/run.py","prior_finding_id":"arf_v1_airpqn5cq3y57oztz6av4w7kyf","published_at":"2026-10-05T06:12:26Z","review_id":"arr_v1_6wm2bprwt6d656bvg435c7hxnz","reviewed_base_sha":"631b78d1b505b157eee758662291fc5e2353bbb6","reviewed_head_sha":"612c25e99cea0cff7be65f0bcc0684ba73bd13ce","reviewer":"codex","start_line":964,"suggestion_id":""},"pull_request":{"number":745},"record_id":"art_v1_mnpl3lgxcgwh2i2nvn3pgxdy3s","record_type":"finding_observed","recorded_at":"2026-10-05T06:12:26Z","repository":{"full_name":"aws/aws-durable-execution-sdk-python","id":1052903600},"schema_version":1}
